156f417c000bb91b7c5c6b1d54946cf6decadfbd520a082d7465b14287", "duration": 9.48}, {"id": "fleurs-8e93e440f571a4da", "source": "fleurs", "row": "1887", "revision": "70bb2e84b976b7e960aa89f1c648e09c59f894dd", "reference": "利金斯 (Liggins) 在医院工作时，开始在业余时间研究早产。", "audio_sha256": "8a0cb0baf6fbd1ce4ed2e841beb7aceceacb1a5bb0346dfb2752c2a08aa2d1ed", "duration": 14.12}, {"id": "ascend-zh-6a23208e2c146088", "source": "ascend-zh", "row": "00755", "revision": "737e9800ae31be9932ba8464c80366559bd28424", "reference": "其实我也是到大学才发现就学习不应该是整天", "audio_sha256": "2962a6f5eae36de76bcb2b59ed81cd52c9344c955366c838c849c21ae649750c", "duration": 4.1999375}, {"id": "ascend-zh-ed182ef57fba310b", "source": "ascend-zh", "row": "01061", "revision": "737e9800ae31be9932ba8464c80366559bd28424", "reference": "对然后但是呢就是说确实有一个手机呢带来很多方便", "audio_sha256": "14caf84362f6215af64363932afa13220fdbdd2de3256136db6a2d8b824b682a", "duration": 5.9301875}, {"id": "ascend-zh-4309bc70746a5c2c", "source": "ascend-zh", "row": "00745", "revision": "737e9800ae31be9932ba8464c80366559bd28424", "reference": "因为像你说可能当时的难度比较低然后空余时间比较多可以多一点而且", "audio_sha256": "c7a2127326cc36c700e77ae3840e488c9d2b44b3f5303d7b8925d83a7066b6ff", "duration": 6.3199375}, {"id": "ascend-zh-0c5639a6e24f539b", "source": "ascend-zh", "row": "01070", "revision": "737e9800ae31be9932ba8464c80366559bd28424", "reference": "我我不就是我爸妈就开始买电脑然后我就开始接触一些网络游戏", "audio_sha256": "5f59ef721b132ef77f023bd01032d20a1539d074ef0ded828faddf13ac0b34fb", "duration": 7.22}, {"id": "ascend-mixed-9255615fddf1a721", "source": "ascend-mixed", "row": "00718", "revision": "737e9800ae31be9932ba8464c80366559bd28424", "reference": "他当时也在那个Houston Rockets跟team up with McGrady", "audio_sha256": "e4d9f5aaff9858ff0710a2f2e8fb46d4a7d2b2cf81d9ec54532a19e46de12f3f", "duration": 6.46}, {"id": "ascend-mixed-ee4e2d5087648134", "source": "ascend-mixed", "row": "01068", "revision": "737e9800ae31be9932ba8464c80366559bd28424", "reference": "当然我小时候我也没有smartphone但是呢我是小时候比较早接触过那个电脑", "audio_sha256": "9f57d